"Tap **Start pairing** in Husk first and allow **Local Network** access when asked. If you said no earlier, turn it on in Settings › Privacy & Security › Local Network › Husk. Wi-Fi has to be on. Developer Mode must already be enabled, which restarts the iPhone the first time." = "先在 Husk 中点击 **开始配对**，并允许 **本地网络** 访问。如果之前拒绝，请到设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 本地网络 › Husk 开启。Wi-Fi 必须开启；首次启用开发者模式需要重启 iPhone。";
