"• **Opens and closes instantly:** the signing certificate has probably expired. Free Apple accounts last 7 days. Re-sign or reinstall Husk with your sideloader; your apps and saves stay.\n• **“Untrusted Developer”:** go to Settings › General › VPN & Device Management and trust your certificate.\n• **Asks for Developer Mode:** turn it on in Settings › Privacy & Security." = "• **打开后立即退出：**签名证书可能已过期，免费 Apple 账号的签名有效期为 7 天。用侧载工具重新签名或安装，应用和存档会保留。\n• **不受信任的开发者：**到设置 › 通用 › VPN 与设备管理中信任证书。\n• **要求开发者模式：**在设置 › 隐私与安全性中开启。";
"• **iOS 27 or later:** Settings › JIT › Pair on this iPhone. No computer needed.\n• **iOS 26:** StikJIT (built in) with a pairing file made on a computer, plus LocalDevVPN.\n• **Older iOS, or Husk inside LiveContainer:** the StikDebug app.\n• **Installed with TrollStore:** TrollStore, with its URL Scheme setting on.\n• **Jailbroken with Dopamine:** turn on JIT for apps in the jailbreak's settings." = "• **iOS 27 或更高版本：**设置 › JIT › 在此 iPhone 上配对，无需电脑。\n• **iOS 26：**使用内置 StikJIT、在电脑上生成的配对文件以及 LocalDevVPN。\n• **更早的 iOS 或 LiveContainer 内的 Husk：**使用 StikDebug。\n• **通过 TrollStore 安装：**使用 TrollStore，并开启 URL Scheme。\n• **Dopamine 越狱：**在越狱设置中允许应用使用 JIT。";
